---
import { capabilities, mailto } from '../../content/editorial.js';
import ActionIcon from './ActionIcon.astro';
---
<section class="capabilities section wrap" id="capabilities" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="approach-title">How I decide <span>where to spend.</span></h2>
    <p>When I take over an account, I want to know who follows up on a lead, where they record the outcome, and which decision those records can support.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="capability-list">{capabilities.map(step => <article>
    <h3>{step.title}</h3>
    <p>{step.body}</p>
    <p class="tool-line">{step.example}</p>
  </article>)}</div>
  <div class="approach-invite">
    <p>Have a paid media role in mind? I’d be happy to walk through one of these decisions in an interview.</p>
    <a class="button" href={mailto}><ActionIcon name="mail" />Email me about the role</a>
  </div>
</section>
